# nexora-action-code: get_version
# Official Ruijie WS5302 AC RGOS 11.1(2)B1 example:
# https://www-file.ruijie.com.cn/Fu/Article/5c0472f6-ddb1-44d5-9e55-9a01762ee6f8/v3/02%20%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BFWLAN%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E10.X%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC20180131%E7%BB%88%E7%89%88/02%20%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BFWLAN%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%9A%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E10.X%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC20180131%E7%BB%88%E7%89%88/2018092015282200086.html
Value Required SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION (.+?)
Value START_TIME (.+?)
Value UPTIME (.+?)
Value HARDWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value Required SOFTWARE_VERSION (.+?)
Value PATCH_NUMBER (\S+)
Value SOFTWARE_NUMBER (\S+)
Value Required SERIAL_NUMBER (\S+)
Value BOOT_VERSION (\S+)
Value CORE_VERSION (\S+)
Value CPU_PARTITION (\S+)

Start
  ^.*#\s*show\s+ver\s+detail\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+description\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+start\s+time\s*:\s*${START_TIME}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+uptime\s*:\s*${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+hardware\s+version\s*:\s*${HARDWARE_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+software\s+version\s*:\s*${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+patch\s+number\s*:\s*${PATCH_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+software\s+number\s*:\s*${SOFTWARE_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+serial\s+number\s*:\s*${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+boot\s+version\s*:\s*${BOOT_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+core\s+version\s*:\s*${CORE_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*System\s+cpu\s+partition\s*:\s*${CPU_PARTITION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next

EOF
